assets.prompt:
Production game UI sprite atlas, not mockup. Generate 2048x2048 transparent RGBA canvas, exactly 4 columns by 4 rows of equally sized 512x512 cells. Sixteen isolated sprites, each centered entirely inside its own cell, nothing straddling cell boundaries; leave at least 32 transparent pixels around each sprite. Real transparent background, no checkerboard pixels, no labels, no text, no numbers, no watermark. Orthographic front view only, consistent soft upper-left highlight, compact shadow contained in sprite. Polished casual game look: pale honey wood rims, smooth cream inset, rounded bevels, subdued natural grain, green glazed buttons. See reference for style only. All centers blank for runtime text/icons; NEVER draw text or icon unless specified crown. Cell shapes:
row1 col1: WIDE rounded rectangle cream balance panel, light warm wooden bevel rim, aspect 3.8:1;
row1 col2: squat rounded rectangle cream tool tile with thick light wooden bevel rim, aspect1.27:1;
row1 col3: glossy leaf-green rounded button, narrow honeywood outer rim, aspect2.7:1;
row1 col4: glossy warm orange rounded button, gold honeywood rim, aspect2.7:1.
row2 col1: dark walnut horizontal recessed empty progress groove, rounded ends, aspect8:1;
row2 col2: bright leaf-green horizontal progress fill with subtle bevel, rounded ends, aspect8:1;
row2 col3: cream wide rounded speech bubble with tiny centered upward pointer, thin green rim, aspect5.2:1;
row2 col4: identical cream wide rounded speech bubble with centered upward pointer, thin pale lavender rim, aspect5.2:1.
row3 col1: tall rounded hexagonal wooden shield frame with blank CREAM inset, aspect.96:1;
row3 col2: same rounded hexagonal wooden shield frame with blank GREEN inset, aspect.96:1;
row3 col3: same shield with GOLD inset and small existing-style gold crown attached at top, all within cell, overall aspect.84:1;
row3 col4: muted gray-beige disabled rounded tool tile matching row1col2, no icon, aspect1.27:1.
row4 col1: portrait modal cream panel with warm wooden rim, generous blank center, round corners, aspect.78:1; no decoration invading blank center;
row4 col2: green satin title ribbon with small tails behind both ends, blank center, aspect4.6:1;
row4 col3: warm honeywood title sign with small simple ribbon tails, blank cream central face, aspect4.6:1;
row4 col4: cream inset text input rectangle with very thin warm brown border, softly rounded corners, aspect4:1.
Maintain precise 4x4 grid with no overlap. Leave alpha genuinely transparent. No background sheet, no cell outlines. These sprites will be automatically sliced by fixed grid and alpha bounds, so absolutely each asset must fit its cell. Consistent production-ready asset family.
